## Interface: 120100, 120105, 16001
## Title: Forever Cooldown Tracker (Ellesmere UI)
## Notes: Cooldowns, buff timers and buff reminders for every class, healthstones and potions, and old spell ranks on your bars. EllesmereUI fork of Forever Cooldown Tracker. /euict for options.
## Author: Ugge Zen (original), Matt VanNuys (fork)
## IconTexture: Interface/Icons/Spell_Nature_TimeStop
## X-License: MIT
## Version: 1.0.0
## OptionalDeps: !ForeverData, !ForeverDataProtect, EllesmereUI, EllesmereUIActionBars
## SavedVariables: EUICT_DB
## SavedVariablesPerCharacter: EUICT_DBC
